IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. MIN-BAL-FEE.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 WS-BALANCE PIC 9(7).
01 WS-MINIMUM PIC 9(7).
01 WS-FEE PIC 9(7).
01 WS-RESULT PIC 9(7).
01 WS-OUT PIC Z(6)9.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    ACCEPT WS-BALANCE.
    ACCEPT WS-MINIMUM.
    ACCEPT WS-FEE.

    IF WS-BALANCE < WS-MINIMUM

        IF WS-BALANCE >= WS-FEE

            COMPUTE WS-RESULT =
                WS-BALANCE - WS-FEE

            MOVE WS-RESULT TO WS-OUT

            DISPLAY "Resulting Balance: " WS-OUT

        ELSE
            DISPLAY "FEE CANNOT BE COLLECTED"
        END-IF

    ELSE
        MOVE WS-BALANCE TO WS-OUT
        DISPLAY "Resulting Balance: " WS-OUT
    END-IF.

    STOP RUN.
